Modifications and scope deviations from upstream
------------------------------------------------

search.mjs
    Contains substantial logic adapted from upstream
    `skills/native-web-search/search.mjs` (main, fetched 2026-09-27),
    specifically the Anthropic and OpenAI Codex native web-search
    implementations (prompt building, streaming, OAuth/API-key
    resolution, and model selection).

    The Ollama Cloud web_search backend and provider auto-detection
    are original to this repo. Upstream's script supports only
    Anthropic and OpenAI Codex.

SKILL.md
    Original to this repo, describing the unified provider-agnostic
    interface and the Ollama Cloud backend.
